  m_text: 'you will take on the role of a defender of the last stronghold of humanity
    in a world engulfed in a zombie apocalypse. Your task is to prevent the undead
    from breaking through to the forts, using strategy, agility and resource management
    skills.

    From the first minutes of the game, you will find yourself in the
    center of the battle, where zombies attack your fort in waves. For each destroyed
    monster, you will receive coins that can be used to strengthen the defense. Accumulate
    funds to hire new troops, improve their abilities and create powerful barriers
    that will slow down or stop the enemy.'
